WEBVTT

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:36.980
After experiencing the power of a digital
Sacred Beast first hand, we started to panic.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.820
Our feelings were in tatters,

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.630
but what saved the BBA team
from the face of destruction

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.270
was a cookout held by Hiromi.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.640
Hey, that one's mine!

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:06.370
I won't lose!

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:10.560
Dragoon!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.720
Afterwards, we had a refreshing battle with Kane and friends!

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:20.800
The BBA team faces the approaching
battle against the digital Sacred Beasts,

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.930
with renewed resolve!

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:26.100
Now it's over!

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.020
I won't lose!

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.910
Mr. Gideon, I have brought them.

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:59.010
Well then, kids, show me how much your training has paid off.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:02:59.930
Here.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:07.840
What's this?

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:13.660
These are shooters and visors developed by Team Psykick.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.090
Put these on.

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.500
Good. Now, you will battle against our robo-shooter.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.210
Jim. You're up first.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.060
So this is Cyber Draciel?

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:41.320
I like the shape of the Attack Ring.
The balance is good, too. It's perfect.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.790
I think it's worth giving a shot.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.970
Ready?

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.370
Come on!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:56.310
Go, Shoot!

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.080
What?!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.930
What's the meaning of this?

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.220
This is crazy! It can hardly be considered a battle!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.410
Stop this, now!

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.810
Don't worry about it.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.400
Keep quiet and watch.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.440
What?

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:30.430
The Sacred Beast index has surpassed the critical point!

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:37.860
What?!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.400
What is this thing?

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.260
It's a digital Sacred Beast!

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:45.690
Yes! The spirit of a beast that lies within a Bey!

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:48.600
This is the secret of a digital Bey's power!

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:51.600
Go! Rip 'em apart!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.440
Look at that power!

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.980
Amazing... There are Beyblades
like this out there?

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:03.790
Don't be surprised just yet. This is where fun starts.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.810
That thing is huge!

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:14.320
This is a Bey we designed
for you to practice with.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.460
For practice?

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.280
Awright, I'm in!

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:20.210
Go, Cyber Draciel!

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.300
What?!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:28.930
Is this even a battle?

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.130
The battle index has
surpassed critical value!

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:36.350
Here it comes.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.490
What just happened?

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:44.090
The digital Sacred Beast just evolved.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.300
Evolved?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.120
What is this power?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:54.120
Stop this! If this keeps up,
Jim will be in danger!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.740
That just means he
wasn't a worthy Blader.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:59.420
N-No...!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.560
Withstand it. If you do, you will grow accustomed to the power.

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:06.820
And become a perfected Blader.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.800
I refuse to lose!

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.520
Go, Cyber Draciel!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.660
So that's a digital Sacred Beast?
It's good stuff.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.410
It's awesome!

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:56.960
Jim...

00:06:57.740 --> 00:07:01.650
Mr. Gideon, these are the
Bladers we've been searching for.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:08.980
These kids can probably master the digital Sacred Beasts in two weeks. No, one!

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.240
The time for us to obtain the
four Sacred Beasts has come.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.140
This is big!

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:24.260
What's the matter, Kyoujyu?

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.210
It's them! Them!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.500
Them?

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.170
No time to explain! Come with me!

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.680
Absolutely not!

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:37.380
Absolutely not?

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:41.800
Are you rejecting our
offer for an official battle?

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:45.980
I know your plan is related
to the four Sacred Beasts.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:50.720
I cannot allow the BBA team
to battle a team such as yours!

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.900
I guess we don't have a choice.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.210
I suppose I'll let the digital
Sacred Beasts go loose.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.300
What did you say?

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:04.820
If I let a Beyblade with a digital Sacred
Beast in it enter a typical tournament...

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.770
What do you think will happen?

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:15.600
You couldn't possibly...

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:20.070
While we could, we would
prefer it not come to that.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.530
How underhanded...

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:25.840
Mr. Kinomiya!

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.910
We heard the whole thing.

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:30.130
We accept!

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.700
You cowards!

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.790
We'll never let you unleash
Sacred Beasts on the city!

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:38.210
Guys, don't steal my lines!

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:43.250
So you accept our challenge, then.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.920
Mr. Kinomiya...

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.400
You're damn straight we do!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.640
I don't care about your
digital Sacred Beasts! We'll fight you!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.960
Now that's more in
line with the BBA team.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:57.280
The battle will be in one week.
I will give you the location later.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.430
This is unfortunate...

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.040
Don't worry, old man!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.420
We'll never lose to them!

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.290
This time we'll beat
'em black and blue!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:18.030
This is Kane Yamashita, isn't it?

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:20.820
And Salima, Jim, and Goki.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.860
Do you know them?

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:25.200
Of course!

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:30.810
There aren't that many Bladers out
there who can go toe-to-toe with Takao.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.240
Is something the matter?

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.960
It's them.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:38.660
They're who you will battle.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:39.620
Huh?

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.190
No way...

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:43.290
Yes.

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:44.640
You're kidding me...

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.380
I can't believe this.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:52.380
Don't joke like that!
Kane would never join up with them.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.850
This is no laughing matter!

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.600
So it's true, then?

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:57.490
Yes.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:58.880
No...

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:02.690
Takao!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.210
What's going on?

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.880
I don't get it!

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:10.240
Damn, he's gone!

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:11.350
Takao!

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:13.700
I don't buy it!

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:18.140
I don't buy that Kane
would join their side!

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:22.220
I wouldn't never believe he'd
battle to steal our Sacred Beasts!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.760
Takao...

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:28.160
What?! A battle in one week?!

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.870
I hear the official challenge
went in to the BBA today.

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:33.640
And so, did they...?

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:35.250
Did they accept?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.150
Yeah.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.900
They sure are full of themselves...

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.660
I didn't expect they'd
challenge them directly.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.190
They're confident.

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:46.830
I guess they found them, then.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.020
Bladers who can control
the digital Sacred Beasts.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.360
Go, Shoot!

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.810
Good, Max!

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:01.580
Go, go!

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.360
You're getting the hang of it!

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.520
How long are you going to mope?

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.660
This is unusual for you, Takao.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:11.630
What?

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:16.130
We don't know if what they did
earlier was part of their plan.

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:20.230
To get close to us and
pretend to be our friends.

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:23.540
So we won't be able to
fight them seriously.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:25.890
Kane isn't that kind of guy!

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:28.310
How do you know that?

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:33.490
Go!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.440
I won't lose!

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.200
I just know.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:46.890
Kane... he isn't the kind of
guy to battle for Psykick!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.400
Why don't you see for yourself?

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.120
Ozma!

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.490
What do you want?!

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:59.900
Why don't you see if Kane's
the guy you think he is

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.160
with your own two eyes?

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.340
What?

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:04.760
No way!

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:08.290
Not even the BBA
knows where they are!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.830
Do you know where their base is?

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:27.280
So those Psykicks
were here all along...

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.680
Are we really going in?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.090
I don't think we should.
What if we get caught?

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:36.180
You don't have to if you don't want to!
But I wanna see.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:38.850
If Kane is really in here...

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.080
But what are we going to do?

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:43.440
I don't think we
can sneak in so easily.

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:44.490
Over there!

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:46.260
Takao!

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:49.520
Kyoujyu!

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:50.810
Yes!

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:54.890
Guys, wait!

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:57.310
Don't blame me...

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:07.930
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:21.040
Okay. The coast is clear.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:28.310
I guess we got in...

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.810
Hey, Hiromi...

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:38.340
You know we're very obviously
committing a crime, don't you?

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.210
Let's get out of here!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:44.300
Zip it! If you want to
leave so bad, you can go!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.750
No...

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:51.200
Hiromi, listen to me!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.920
What do you mean you won't use these Beys?

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:02.880
You guys saw the power of the
digital Sacred Beasts, didn't you?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:06.330
Have you ever
seen so much power?

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.290
Mr. Gideon was right.

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.860
This is the ultimate Beyblade!

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.560
Listen, Jim.

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:15.350
What do you think
we've been training for?

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:19.280
Are you happy with brute strength?

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:20.920
What do you mean?

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:24.420
She's saying that battle
earlier was lower than low!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:25.780
What?

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:29.810
Jim, what did you feel
in that last battle?

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.400
You don't remember, do you?

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:34.010
Do you know why you don't?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:39.700
Your spirit has been overtaken
with the allure of power!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:44.180
Come on, Jim. Try to remember.
Is that how we battle?

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:46.640
Is winning all that matters?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:51.680
How we battle?
We did used to go on about stuff like that...

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:52.710
What?!

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:55.250
You guys can do
what you want.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:58.660
I'm going to master this thing.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:03.740
I'll use this to become
an invincible Blader!

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:04.830
Jim...

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:09.930
Our battle is in a week.
By then it'll be too late for regrets!

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.040
Jim...

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.290
Damn traitors, the lot of them...

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.120
Calm down, Doctor.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:21.730
B-but Mr. Gideon!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:25.250
Once they use the digital
Sacred Beasts once, that's it.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:30.210
There isn't a Blader alive who
wouldn't be allured by its power.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.090
We still have plenty of time left, Doctor.

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:41.740
Come on, Hiromi!

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:43.770
Back off, Kyoujyu!

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:46.080
We've made it so
far so stop whining!

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.820
Aww...

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:03.000
I see... so the Bey is set here...

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.530
This is one impressive laboratory...

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.600
Hurry up, Kyoujyu.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:12.800
Someone's coming!

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:18.090
Where's the Doctor?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.100
Hey! You two!

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:25.640
Um, he left here earlier!

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:26.540
Oh, really?

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.640
All's well that ends well...

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.980
I'm getting bored of the machines...

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.960
Does anyone wanna battle me?

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.590
I don't care how many.

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:00.090
What a bunch of cowards.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:01.600
I'll battle you!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:03.600
Goki.

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.490
Don't worry.

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:08.440
I'm going to fix
Jim's crooked attitude.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.480
Heads up.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.370
Don't come crying
to me with regrets.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.880
What?!

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:20.420
Goki, you've always
looked down on me.

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:24.390
But you're in for a bad wake-up call if
you think I'm the same guy I used to be.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.790
I'll grind your worthless
Beyblade into scrap metal!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:31.380
Is that all the trash
talk you've got? Come on!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:37.010
Things are starting to pick up.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.430
Kane!

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.340
Kane... You're...

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.860
He really was a part of Psykick...

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.730
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.640
I'll make you open your eyes, Jim!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:10.580
Go!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.710
Incredible defense...
I can't make it budge!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:30.590
I thought you were
going to open my eyes!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.390
You call this a battle?

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:38.190
I'll show you a real battle!

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:39.590
What?!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:41.940
Cyber Draciel!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:55.620
Cyber Draciel...?

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:58.110
No! This is unbelievable!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:01.710
It's powered up so much
since the last time we saw one!

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:04.690
I'll make sure you never
forget Cyber Draciel's power!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:05.930
Now, go!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.580
It's powerful... How did
it become so powerful?

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:40.770
Kane!

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:42.190
Kane!!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.900
Are you crazy?!

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:46.620
Kane's being fooled!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.210
I have to tell him!

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:50.640
Kane!

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:51.940
Kinomiya!

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.360
You're just being tricked!

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.830
Don't listen to them!

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.110
Kane!!

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:12.020
No good. It's locked!

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.020
Here they come!

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:16.830
Kai!

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:19.810
This was completely unnecessary.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.110
This way.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:29.590
There they are!

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.840
This way!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:36.220
You called Kai, didn't you, Max?

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:37.430
Yeah, you got me.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.730
So our opponents will be--

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:43.870
Takao Kinomiya and his team.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.890
I can fight him again...

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:48.800
In a battle where our souls clash...

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:51.680
Have you decided to use it, then?

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:55.000
Our... Digital Beys.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.300
Sorry, Doctor.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:03.610
There won't be any tricks in our battle.

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:08.610
I will fight him with my own skills.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:21.810
Kane...

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:25.590
Was that battle a lie after all?

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:28.610
What happened to you?

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:29.810
Kane...

00:22:59.360 --> 00:23:02.240
One night, with the battle against the
digital Sacred Beasts ever approaching...

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:04.880
Rei coincidentally meets
with a certain someone.

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:08.130
What? If it isn't Salima!

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:09.620
She's the enemy! The enemy!

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:13.390
Sorry, ma... is that supposed
to be a pun on Salima?

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:17.560
Either way, what exactly
did she say to Rei?

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:20.810
You won't want to miss next
week's episode, Chairman!
